      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this is a good idea.\n\nMy main avatars, \"Moe(萌)\" and \"Selestia(セレスティア)\", each have about 40 outfit variations, and I have separate avatars for each outfit to save weight.\n\nI have not experienced any problems when using these avatars on a regular basis. But if I want to use an avatar other than the two I mentioned above, and I can't think of a better way to put this, for example, if I want to find an avatar who has uploaded only one costume, it is not easy to find that one avatar in this sea of 264 avatars.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
